@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam PackageBorderColor #9ca3af

title FindCare: three capabilities, four tools each, and which of the twelve the code and the record actually carry

legend top right
|<#dcfce7>   | declared in ToolConfiguration and dispatched by running code |
|<#fef3c7>   | the work happens, but no tool is declared for it |
|<#fee2e2>   | declared, and the file that would serve it is imported by nothing |
|<#e5e7eb>   | no tool, no endpoint |
endlegend

package "Find an individual care giver\npage: individualProvider" {
  component "ProviderSearch\nsearch\n/provider/find" as PS #dcfce7
  component "SpecialtyFilter\nvocabulary chooser\n/specialty/find" as SF #dcfce7
  component "ProviderDetail\ndetail\n/provider-detail" as PD #dcfce7
  component "ProviderSelection\nselection\nprovider_selection" as PSel #dcfce7
}

package "Find a facility\npage: facility" {
  component "FacilitySearch\nsearch\n/facility/find" as FS #dcfce7
  component "facility kinds\nvocabulary chooser\ninside /facility/find" as FVoc #fef3c7
  component "FacilityDetail\ndetail\n/provider-detail" as FD #dcfce7
  component "FacilitySelection\nselection\nfacility_selection" as FSel #dcfce7
}

package "Find a clinical trial\npage: clinicalTrial" {
  component "ClinicalTrials\nsearch\n/trial/find" as CT #dcfce7
  component "condition wording\nvocabulary chooser\nmining prompt only" as CVoc #e5e7eb
  component "trial detail\ndetail" as CD #e5e7eb
  component "ClinicalTrialSelection\nselection\nclinical_trial_selection" as CSel #dcfce7
}

component "facility_search_tool.py\nshipped, imported by nothing" as FSdead #fee2e2

FS .right. FSdead

' Stack the three subjects vertically so the grid is four across, not twelve.
PS -[hidden]down- FS
FS -[hidden]down- CT

note bottom of FVoc
  A facility's kinds are resolved by the same
  SpecialtyFilter funnel on the Non-Individual
  partition, called from _facility_kinds inside the
  search route. Because it is not a tool, no
  requirement can be stated against it:
  offeredFacilityTypes and selectedTaxonomyCodes are
  declared against FacilitySearch instead, so the
  chooser cannot be asked for on its own.
end note

note bottom of CVoc
  The trial page turns words into a condition string
  inside its mining prompt. Nothing intersects the
  answer with a catalogue, so unlike the NUCC funnel
  there is no registry fact the model is held to.
end note

note bottom of CD
  openNctId is declared and the page records which
  trial is on screen, but no tool and no route serve a
  trial detail: the React widget paints it from the
  search result it already cached.
  EPIC-006-F-004-S-001 is the gap.
end note

note right of FSdead
  Nothing imports it. The router posts straight to the
  /facility/find URL, so the file ships into the
  SharedServices container on every deploy and no code
  path reaches it.
end note

note bottom of FD
  Declared as its own tool, served by the
  ProviderDetail tool with entity_type "2". There is
  no facility_detail_tool.py; the declaration names an
  endpoint two tools share.
end note

@enduml
